                              Aws  Global Accelerator
Without Global Accelerator: A user in Ethiopia connects to your application through the normal internet route, which may be slow or congested.
With Global Accelerator: The user connects to the nearest AWS edge location, and AWS carries the traffic across its high-speed global network to your application.

Benefits
Faster performance
AWS often provides a shorter and more reliable network path than the public internet.
Automatic failover
If one region becomes unhealthy, traffic can be redirected to another region automatically.


